Create <pre><code>await Actor().create(
    {'name': 'John Wick', 'age': 60}
);
</code></pre>

InsertMultiple insert <pre><code>await Actor().insert(
    {'name': 'John Wick', 'age': 60}
);
</code></pre> <pre><code>await Actor().insertMultiple([
    {'name': 'John Wick', 'age': 60},
    {'name': 'John Doe', 'age': 25},
]);
</code></pre> <p>Info</p> <p><code>insert</code> works with any primary key type, for example a uuid string. <code>insertMultiple</code> uses the keys from all rows. When a row does not have a key, that column gets its default value.</p>

