</code></pre>

Count allCount with condition <pre><code>await Actor().count();
</code></pre> <pre><code>await Actor().where('age', '&gt;=' , 23).count();
</code></pre> <p>Info</p> <p><code>count()</code> does not use <code>limit</code>, <code>offset</code> and <code>orderBy</code>. With <code>groupBy</code>, <code>count()</code> returns the number of groups.</p>

