Get from trash <pre><code>List actors = await Actor().where('name', 'John Wick').withTrash().get();
for(Actor actor in actors) {
    print(actor.id)
}
</code></pre> <p>Info</p> <p>This work only with softDeletes. On a model without softDeletes it does nothing.</p>

