Where in conditionWhere not inOr where in / not in <pre><code>await Actor().whereIn('id', ['1', '2']).get();
</code></pre> <pre><code>await Actor().whereNotIn('id', [1, 2]).get();
</code></pre> <pre><code>await Actor().where('age', 60).orWhereIn('id', [1, 2]).get();
await Actor().where('age', 60).orWhereNotIn('id', [1, 2]).get();
</code></pre> <p>Info</p> <p>Each value is sent as a bound parameter. An empty list matches no rows for <code>whereIn</code>, and all rows for <code>whereNotIn</code>.</p>

